From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 22:58:21 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Suitability model: plain-language reasons for every score

XGBoost's own exact TreeSHAP contributions are taken from the same leave-one-city-out model
that produced each score, then turned into the top 3 reasons per crop and city in plain words
and saved to ml_species_city_explanations. No extra package needed.

- explain_suitability: feature wording and build_explanations
- train_suitability: with_contributions option, saves the reasons table
- tests: contributions add up to the score, wording by hand, every feature has plain wording

